  <string name="permissions_required_rationale_title">Important Permissions Required</string>
  <string name="permissions_required_rationale_text"><![CDATA[This app configured to provide remote peer-to-peer (P2P) access to your camera and microphone, enabling live streaming on demand.\n\nTo function properly, we need the following permissions:\n\n- **Camera & Microphone**: Required to stream video and audio. Without these, remote viewing is impossible.\n- **Notifications** (Android 13+): Necessary to run the camera in the foreground, ensuring reliable streaming. Without this, Android will block access.\n\nGranting these permissions ensures uninterrupted service. You can revoke them anytime in system settings.]]></string>
